Daśatattvasaṃgraha of Kṣitigarbha (not final)

Klein-Schwind, Sabine Gudrun (Oktober 2012). The Compendium of the Ten Fundamentals: Daśatattvasaṃgraha of paṇḍita Kṣitigarbha. Critical Edition of the Sanskrit Text with Introduction and Annotated English Translation. Dissertation zur Erlangung der Würde eines Doktors der Philosophie der Universität Hamburg, Fakultät für Geisteswissenschaften.

---

[p. 187]

namo vajrasattvāya ||

vajrasattvaṃ guruṃ natvā taddharmaṃ sūnusaṃhatim | 
daśa tattvāni kathyante jñānapādakrameṇa tu || 1

rakṣācakraṃ ca cakraṃ ca jāpaḥ sekau haṭho baliḥ | 
pratyaṅgire puṭodghāṭas tattvāni kramaśo daśa || 2

hṛnnyastanijabījotthaprabhāvyūhair jagatkṛtim | 
kṛtvā tair eva buddhādīn ākṛṣya purato dhiyā || 3

vandanāṃ ca tathā pūjāṃ deśanām anumodanām | 
buddhādīn śaraṇaṃ gatvā mārgam āśrayate tataḥ | 
bodhicittam athotpādya trivimokṣamukhaṃ smaret || 4

FOLIO MISSING (i. rakṣācakra:) 
dikoṇeṣu ṭakkidaṇḍabalācalān || (2)

uṣṇīṣcakravarty ūrdhvaṃ sumbharājas tv adhaḥ smṛtaḥ | 
sarve hūṃkārajāḥ krodhā uṣṇīṣo bhrūṃbhavaḥ param || (3)

pratyālīḍhasthitāḥ sarve ravimaṇḍalino ravau | 
svābhavidyāsukhāsvādayuktāliṅgitavigrahāḥ || (4)

prajñāpadmāntakoṣṇīṣād anye nīlāḥ prakīrtitāḥ | 
prajñāntakādayo śuklaraktapītā yathākramam || (5)

[p. 188]

yamapadmāntakau tyaktvā ye 'nye te 'kṣobhyamaulayaḥ | 
yamāreḥ śāśvato maulāv amitābho 'parasya tu || (6)

mudgaram aṅkuśaṃ daṇḍaṃ nīladaṇḍaṃ saroruham | 
triśūlaṃ kuliśaṃ khaḍgaṃ pītaṃ cakraṃ ca vajrakam || (7)

saccihnaṃ dakṣiṇe haste kekarasyācalasya tu | 
vāme cakraṃ ca pāśaś ca vyālābharaṇabhūṣaṇaḥ || (8)

krodhadordaṇḍasaṃchannaṃ jvālāmālākulaprabham | 
bhramantaṃ dakṣiṇāvartaṃ suvegān niścalopamam || (9)

ye daśārāsthitāḥ krodhāḥ mahābalaparākramāḥ |
te tu niścalato dhyeyāḥ prajñopāyasukhātmakāḥ || (10)

śīlasamādhayaḥ prajñā vimuktijñānadarśanam | 
vimuktiś ceti pañcaiva skandhā lokottarā amī || (11)

ādarśasamatāpratyavekṣaṇāvīryaśuddhitāḥ | 
daśajñānaviśuddhās te krodhā dhyeyāḥ suniścitāḥ || (12)

hīnayānanipātāde rakṣārthaṃ cakragasya tu | 
nābhyantaḥ śuṣirasthāyivajrahūṃkārahṛdgatā | 
mudrā dharmodayā tasyāṃ kūṭāgārādi bhāvayet || (13)

(ii. cakra:)
tatra bhrūṃkāracakrotthasavidyaśāśvatodbhavam | spharadbuddhaughakhavyāpicaturaśrādisaṃyutam || 1

śaśisūryasamākrāntaviśvābjadevatāsanam | 
vibhaktāśeṣasadratnaṃ kūṭāgāraṃ prabhāvayet || 2

tatra madhyāsane candraṃ dvātriṅśallakṣaṇānvitam | 
anuvyañjanakālaiś ca tatra hṛdbhavaṃ hūṃ kṛtiḥ |

[p. 189]

spharasaṃhāratas tasmād vajrasattvasamudbhavaḥ || 3

sphaṭikendvaṅgamūlāsyaṃ nīlasavyāruṇetaram | 
vajrakhaḍgabhujaṃ savye vāme satmaṇipadminam ||4

prajñopāyātmakaṃ śrīmaj jagatsampatsamāśrayam | 
samantabhadram ātmānaṃ bhāvayet spharaṇatviṣam || 5

krodhādidevatāḥ sarvās trimukhāḥ ṣaḍbhujā iha | svābhaprajñāṅgasaṅgāptānandādvaitādbhutasvanāḥ || 6

sarveṣāṃ dakṣiṇe khaḍgaṃ ratnam padmaṃ ca vāmataḥ | 
savye' bjaṃ vā maṇir yeṣāṃ cakraṃ teṣāṃ tu vāmataḥ || 7

sarveṣāṃ dakṣiṇaṃ nīlaṃ nīlasya vadanaṃ sitam | 
sarveṣāṃ dhavalaṃ vāmaṃ raktaṃ tu sitakṛṣṇayoḥ || 8

mahārāgavineyaṃ tu lokam ālokya bhājanam | 
suratadhvaninā svāntar jinavṛndaṃ niveśayet || 9

locanārūpavajrādirūpāḥ prajñānurāgaṇāt |
protsṛjya navadhā devīs tadvidyāntar niveśayet || 10

punaḥ svayoṣitpa<dma>sthaṃ suratodbhavamaṇḍalam | 
nirmāyātra jagatkṛtsnam āśvāsāya praveśayet || 11

khavyāpisarvasaṃbuddhaiḥ svavajrāntardravodbhavaiḥ | 
sevayed avivartyarthaṃ tattvajñānaphalāptaye || 12

āśvastaṃ taj jagad dṛṣṭvā svasvabījaṃ samutsṛjet || 13

[p. 190]

kṣiṃ jraṃ khaṃ gaṃ skam ity ebhiḥ saṃbījāc ca yathākramam | 
kṣitigarbhādikān ṣaṭkāṃś cakṣurādiviśuddhitaḥ || 14

jaḥ hūṃ vaṃ hoḥ khaṃ raṃ bījād rūpavajrādirūpiṇaḥ | 
lāṃ māṃ pāṃ tāṃ iti tv ebhir locanādisvabhāvān || 15

buṃ āṃ jrīṃ khaṃ hūṃ bījād buddhān skandhādirūpiṇaḥ || 16

oṃ āḥ hūṃ iti <tac> cittaṃ bhāsvaddhorbhyāṃ vidarbhitam | 
guhyapadmodarāntas tad viśad dravati rāgataḥ || 17

tanmahārāgatas tau ca prajñopāyau dravaṃ gatau |
tvaṃ vajretyādigāthābhir devī<saṃcoda>nāṃ smaret || 18

utthāpanyanurodhena dravaṃ paśyan vipattivat |
māyāvad vastu saṃvittyā tad dravād bījasambhavaḥ || 19

maṃbījodbhavakhaḍgotthamañjuvajraḥ svayam bhavet | 
kuṅkumākāramūlāśyanīlasavyasitetaraḥ || 20

kumārābharaṇākāraḥ prajñānandaikasundaraḥ | 
dvibhujāśliṣṭasatprajñaḥ svābhaprajñādharāsyadhṛk || 21

bhāsvatkṛpāṇasadbāṇanīlotpaladhanuḥkarāḥ |

[p. 191]

spharadbuddhaughanirmāṇaniṣpāditajagattrayaḥ || 22

dhyāyād akṣobhyaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ vā madhye hūṃjātavajrajam | 
sāmānyamaṇḍale hy asmin dhyāyān nāyakam icchayā || 23

bhavasaṅgodbhavo' nantaḥ śamasaṅgo vipattibhāk | 
māyayā kṛtasaṃsevo dharmadhātvātmako bhavet || 24

oṃ dharmadhātu svabhāvātmako' ham || 
mṛdusevāṅganiṣyandaphalotpattyā nivartate |

sāsravam ālayavijñāṇam ādarśajñānasambhavaḥ || 25 
kṣitīśakuliśākāśalokeśaskambhibhadra<kai>ḥ |

sampūrya cakṣurādīni bījaiḥ sarvajñatām iyāt || 26

śāśvatādisvarūpābhās taccihnadhāritatkulāḥ | 
bodhisattvāḥ samantas tu vajrasattvakṛtiḥ kṛtī || 27

mṛdūpasādhanāṅgena vipākaphalayoginā 
utpādya samatājñānaṃ kliṣṭamano nivartayet || 28

dharmāsambhoganirmāṇavāhinī jagadarthatā | 
cittaguhyādyadhiṣṭhānaṃ sādhanāṅgam ataḥ sṛjet || 29

svahṛtkaṇṭhaśiraścandre hūṃāḥoṃjāś ca satprabhūn | 
vajrābjacakramadhyasthān svahṛccihnasthabījakān || 30

dhyātvā tadbījaraśmibhyo rūpavajrādimūrtibhiḥ | 
sampūjyā diggatān nāthān teṣāṃ trivajravajriṇaḥ | 
cittavajrādigāthābhis tadadhiṣṭhānaṃ prayācayet || 31

[p. 192]

yācitāṃś cittavajrādin svacittādau praveśya ca
oṃ sarvety ādi mantreṇa tadahaṅkṛtimaḍ bhavet || 32

sādhanāṅge mṛdau tasmin puruṣakārasambhavāt | 
kṣīṇaḥ kalpavikalpaś ca pratyavekṣodayakṣaṇāt || 33

cittavajrordhvato jñānasattvaḥ samayavat mataḥ | 
svabījacihnajaś candre svabījāṅkitacihnahṛt || 34

saṃcodya diggatān nāthān jñānasattvahṛdarciṣā | 
tatprabhodbhavavidyābhir bhṛtakumbhāmṛtāmbubhiḥ | 
svabhiṣiktaḥ prabhuḥ śrīmān kuleśaḥ makuṭo bhavet || 35

mahāsādhanato jāte phale vaimalyanāmani |
kṣīṇaṃ pravṛttivijñānaṃ kṛtyānuṣṭhānasambhavāt || 36

niṣyandādyais tathā madhyaiḥ svābhāṃ prajñām viśodhayet || 37

śirohṛtnābhiguhye' syāś caraṇān te ca pratyaṇūn |
oṃ hūṃ svā āḥ hā ca bījaiḥ śāśvatādikulātmakaiḥ ||38

āpūrya pañcasambuddhaiḥ hūṃ-āḥ-satpadmakarṇikām | 
saṃviśodhya tayā buddhān hūṃ-sadvajro' nurāgayet || 39

oṃ sarvatathāgatānurāgaṇavajrasvabhāvātmako' ham || 
hṛccandracihnahṛdbhābhiḥ khavyāpibuddhamaṇḍalam | 
niveśyātmani saccittarūpaṃ vajrābjasaṃsthitam || 40

jinavṛndaṃ svabīje<na> tatrotpādya sthirīkṛtam | 
utsṛjed vidhinānena jagatsv ajñānaśuddhaye || 41

saṃcodyādhipam akṣobhyaṃ mahādveṣārthakṛjjinam | 
vajradhṛg iti vajreśam indranīlamaṇiprabham | 
saṃhṛtyātmani sacchrīmān sarvabhāvair niveśayet || 42

[p. 193]

jinajig iti cādyābhaṃ mahāmohārthakṛjjinam |
utsṛjya cakrabhṛnnāthaṃ dhyāyāt pūrṇendumaṇḍale || 43

ratnadhṛg iti ratneśaṃ pītaś ca samatodyamam | 
utsṛjya dakṣiṇādiśye kumārāsyaṃ vibhāvayet || 44

ārolig iti vāgīśaṃ mahārāgārthakṛtprabhum | 
raktaṃ padmadharaṃ pṛṣṭhe sūryāsane nirūpayet ||45

prajñādhṛg ity amogheśaṃ mahogrerṣyājanārthadam | 
khaḍgabhṛddharitaśyāmaṃ dhyāyād uttarasūryataḥ || 46

sajaṭāmakuṭāḥ sarve sarvābharaṇabhūṣiṇaḥ || 47

nāyake śāśvatādau tu tatnāyakena maṇḍalāt | 
utsṛjyātmani tadrūpaṃ saṃharet pūrvavat kṛtī || 48

tattatsthāne punar dhyāyād akṣobhyam upanāyakam || 49

moharatīti cāgneyāṃ kāyeśābhā tu locanā | 
dveṣaratīti nairṛtyāṃ citteśacandramāmakī || 50

rāgaratīti vāyavyāṃ vāgīśābhā tu pāṇḍarā | 
vajraratītī caiśānyāṃ tārā ratneśavat smṛtā || 51

cakraṃ raktotpalaṃ divyaṃ paṃkajaṃ pītaṃ utpalam | 
cihnam āsāṃ kramād diṣṭaṃ śiṣṭaṃ svādhipavad diśet || 52

āgneyādicatuḥkoṇe pūrvadvāradvipārśvayoḥ | 
kāyādyābhās tritattvena rūpavajrādayaḥ smṛtāḥ || 53

darpaṇaś ca tathā vīṇā gandha<śaṅkha>rasāyanam | 
vastraṃ dharmodayaś caiva cihnam āsāṃ kramāt matam || 54

candrasthā ratnamakuṭāḥ svābhopāyāṅgasaṃgamāḥ |

[p. 194]

sarvālaṅkāraśṛṅgair āyuktā devyaḥ kṛpādvayāḥ || 55

prāgdvāre krodhaparyaṅkaś citteśākārabhāsuraḥ | 
yamāntakṛd <it>ītighnaḥ skandhajñeyavināśakaḥ || 56

kāyeśābhogradṛgbhīmo ’vāgdvāre 'parājitaḥ | 
prajñāntakṛd itīcchāghna ātmadṛkkleśahānitaḥ || 57

mṛtyujanmāghasaṃghātī pṛṣṭhadvāre 'śvakandharaḥ | 
padmāntakṛd itīkṣāghno vāgīśābhograśabditaḥ || 58

akṣobhyābhogravighnaghna uttare 'mṛtakuṇḍaliḥ | 
vighnāntakṛd iti dvāre kriyāsurādiśuddhitaḥ ||59

bhrūbhaṅgordhvajvalatkeśababhrubhrūśmaśrulocanāḥ | vyāvṛtāśyālalajjihvāḥsadaṃṣṭrotkaṭahāsinaḥ || 60

sūryamaṇḍalinaḥ sarve krodhāḥ sūryādhabhāsinaḥ | 
vajramudgaradaṇḍābjasvavajrādikarās tvamī || 61

krūrabhujaṅgabhūṣāṅgāḥ svābhavidyāṅgasaṅginaḥ | 
kharvālambo<da>rā dhyeyās trimaṇḍaladṛśo 'dvayāḥ || 62

niṣpannacakram ālokyānandasaṃdohabhāvataḥ | 
hṛdbījāt aṃkuśair buddhān jñānacakrasamāhṛtān || 63

datvārghādyambu saṃjaptaṃ candrādikusumānvitam | 
cakre niveśya tac cakraṃ cakṣuḥkāyādyadhiṣṭhitam |

[p. 195]

prāgvat siktaṃ ca tad dhyāyān niṣyandādyadhimātrataḥ || 64

buddhānāṃ makuṭe vajrī śeṣāḥ svādhipasekinaḥ | 
phalena hetum āmudrya phalam āmudrya hetunā | 
kāyeśākṣobhyavāgīśacitteśair dvāriṇo matāḥ || 65

ity āsicya svahṛdbhābhiḥ prajñābjāntarniveśitam |
rūpādyaṃ romakūpottharūpavajrādibhiḥ puram |
sampūjya svaṃ munīndrāṃś ca pūjyapūjātmako bhavet || 66

oṃ sarvatathāgatapūjāvajrasvabhāvātmako' ham || 
akṣobhyetyādigāthābhiḥ stuyāc cakraṃ svarūpataḥ | 
antarīkṣagataṃ dhyeyaṃ vajraṃ hūṃ-kārasaṃbhavam || 67

oṃ-kārāṅkitān amṛtān madhye tatra niveśayet || 68

adhovāyvagnicakreṇa tāpitaṃ śodhitaṃ tathā | 
oṃ-kāraraśminā vajraṃ saṃpātyaikīkṛtaṃ param || 69

hūṃ-nyastavajrasajjihvo dhyātvā jñānāmṛtair bhṛtam | 
hṛccandrāntargatāśeṣaṃ cakraṃ tena pratarpayet || 70

bhojanasamaye 'py evaṃ svabhojanaṃ sādhayet kṛtī || 71

tadraśminirmitair nāthaiḥ svāsatsaṃkalpavarjitam | 
buddhātmakaṃ jagat kṛtvā hṛdbījāntar niveśayet || 72

hṛccihnavaraṭāntasthaṃ candrahṛdbindurūpakam | 
prabhāsvat svamano dhyātvā jñānasattvaṃ prabhāsayet || 73

[p. 196]

cittavākkāyavajraṃ ca samayasattvam eva ca |
maṇḍalaṃ ca tayābhāsya spharantyā raśmimālayā || 74

saṃhārād dhṛdi tāṃ dhyāyāt sajjñānāmṛtavāhinīm | pratiromaprabhāvyūhair jagadarthaṃ prapūrayan || 75

dhyātvā śūkṣmasvacihnasthaṃ vidyānāsagrasambhavam | municakraṃ svasaṃvedyaṃ sarvasaṃpūrṇadaivatam || 76

dṛṣṭvā sthairyanimittaṃ spharaṇaṃ tadraśminirgataiḥ | 
buddhair nānāvidhaiḥ kuryāc cihnair vānyathā na tu || 77

mūrdhnīndupraṇavārdrāṃ tu saccittavārivāhanīm | 
vidhivat pātayan kuryāt kāyavākcittaprīṇanam || 78

viśramyaivaṃ japaṃ kṛtvā jñānacakraṃ visarjya ca | 
tritattvāhitasaccakraḥ garvam patyuḥ samudvahan || 79

evaṃ tattvadṛśā muktaṃ jagat sarvam vilokya ca | 
praṇidhānaṃ vidhāyātra kṛpayā taddhitāya ca || 80

vajrasattvasvarūpeṇa dharmān paśya caret kṛtī || 81

sandhyāntare' pi tritattvāc ca pūrṇaṃ saṃsphārya maṇḍalam | 
pūjājapādikaṃ kṛtvā pūrvavad vidadhīta saḥ || 82

pūrvavat prātar utthāya bhavayed ādikarmikaḥ || 83

jñāne kiṃcitsamāveśī jhaṭity ālaṃbya maṇḍalam | 
cakṣuḥkāyādy adhiṣṭhāya japet sandhyāsv atandritaḥ || 84

sarvākārasuniṣpannaṃ spharatsaṃhārakārakam | 
kiṃcitprāpte vaśe yogī santataṃ yogam āśrayet || 85

samyagjñāna<va>śī dhyāyan kuryāt sarvajagaddhitam || 86

[p. 197]

evaṃ vibhāvya saccakraṃ labdhvā nimittam eva ca | 
cakrastho vidhivaj japtvā svayam vādhyeṣito' pi vā | parārthaghaṭamā<no> vā siddhikāmo ’tha vā likhet || 87

cakrimantraṃ japel lakṣam anyeṣām ayutaṃ tathā || 88

tritattvair garbhitaṃ bījam utsargaṃ vā tathā kṛtam |
yathaiva bhāvitaṃ cakraṃ tathaivaṃ lekhyaṃ maṇḍalam || 89

kin tv atra devatāsthāne lekhyaṃ svacihnaṃ yathoditam | 
locanāyāḥ paraṃ sthāne netraṃ lekhyaṃ vicakṣaṇaiḥ || 90

ādikarmā svayaṃ kuryād dvitīyo' pi tathā vidhuḥ | 
āveśenaiva kurvīta tṛtīyo maṇḍalaṃ kṛtī || 91

dvādaśābde samāveśya sampūjya bālabālike |
tābhyāṃ yad <ra>cayec cakraṃ na tathā pūrvayoginoḥ || 92

prāptajñānavaśī kuryāc cetasaiva hi maṇḍalam | 
tadadhiṣṭhānataś cakraṃ dṛśyate svaparair yataḥ || 93

cakradevatayos tattvam idānīm pratipādyate | 
caturasram avaiṣamyād buddhābuddhasamatvataḥ || 94

kāyaviccittadharmāṇāṃ nānaikatvādyayogataḥ |
tatsmṛtis tatra yā śraddhā prāgdvāraṃ bodhaye matam || 95

[p. 198]

bhūtabhāviviparyāsahānyanutpattaye tataḥ | 
abhūtotpannatathyasya cotpattisthitaye tathā || 96

vīryāṇi tatra yad vīryam avāgdvāraṃ tu tair iha || 97

chandovīryasmṛtiprajñā ṛddhipādā <amī matāh> 
amīṣu yā smṛtis taiḥ syāt paścimadvāram atra tu || 98

śraddhāvīryasmṛtidhyānaprajñendriyabalaṃ ca tat | 
tayoḥ samādhiprajñe ca dvādaśottaradvārakam || 99

savitarkaṃ vicāraṃ ca prītisaukhyaṃ vivekajam | 
pañcāṅgaṃ prathamadhyānaṃ avitarkavicāraṇam | 
adhyātmasamprasādaṃ ca caturaṅgaṃ dvitīyakam || 100

samprajanyasukhopekṣācittekāgratayā smṛtiḥ |
tṛtīyam api pañcāṅgaṃ sukhaduḥkhavedanam || 101

smṛty upekṣā viśuddhiś ca vivekajaṃ caturthakam | 
caturbhir uditair dhyānaiḥ pūrvāditoraṇaṃ matam || 102

śūraṃgamaḥ khagaṃjāś ca vimalaḥ siṃhajṛmbhitaḥ | 
sarvasaṃgrāhakair ebhir vedikā syāt samantataḥ || 103

tatra pūjākaravyagragranthādidhāraṇīgaṇaḥ | 
vicitrābharaṇaṃ yasmāj jagadāśāprapūraṇam || 104

vinayoddhūtasaddharmānavāṅgasvaraśuddhitam | 
mārutoddhūtaviśvāgrapatākāghaṇṭanāditam || 105

[p. 199]

kleśānāṃ haraṇaṃ hāraḥ sarvakleśaprahāṇataḥ | 
kleśā<nā>m ardhaharaṇam ardhahāra iti smṛtaḥ || 106

śrag bodhyaṅgaviśuddhā syād ādarśena tu darpaṇaḥ | 
bodhyaṅgāni punaḥ sapta dharmapravicayasmṛtiḥ | 
samādhiprītivīryopekṣāprasrabdhyanuyogataḥ || 107

cāmaraṃ rājacihnatvād buddhasya mārgajñānataḥ || 108

prakṛtiprabhāsvaraśuddhaṃ bodhicittam anuttaram | 
sarvasattvārthasambhūtaṃ candramaṇḍalam ucyate || 109

prajñājñānamayam evaṃ vajropamasamādhijam | 
mokṣālokamahālokaḥ sūryamaṇḍalam ucyate || 110

dharmāhāras tu naivedyaṃ hrīr apatrāpyasamvaram | 
pradīpasumanādhūpagandhākhyaṃ yac ca maṇḍale | 
sugītanṛtyavādyaṃ ca tat mahāsukhavardhanāt || 111

vimokṣāṣṭakasaṃśuddhyā cakraṃ stambhābhiśobhitam || 112

sarvadiktryadhvasaṃbuddhavajrayānapravartanāt | 
vajrāvalīvṛtaṃ śastaṃ samantāt parimaṇḍalam || 113

raṅgāni pañcasambuddhās tajjñānaiḥ sattvarañjanāt | 
sambhārapūriniṣyandāḥ pūrṇakumbhāḥ kṛpārdrataḥ || 114

puraṃ mokṣapuratvāc ca maṇḍalaṃ sārasaṃgrahāt || 115

jñānaskandhamahādveṣaviśuddhadharmadhātutaḥ | 
akṣobhyas tasya śuddhyaivam abjavajraviśodhanam || 116

rūpādarśamahāmohaśuddhitaḥ śāśvataḥ smṛtaḥ | 
vedanāsamatāmānaśuddhito ratnasaṃbhavaḥ || 117

[p. 200]

saṃjñāskandhamahārāgapratyavekṣaṇato 'mitaḥ | kṛtyānuṣṭhānasaṃskāramaherṣyāmoghasambhavaḥ || 118

śūnyatāmukhabhūdhātukṛpopāyais tu locanā | 
animittamahāmaitrījalapraṇidhir māmakī || 119

tejopraṇihitamodābalacittais tu pāṇḍarā | 
upekṣānabhisaṃskāraṃ jñānād vāyoḥ ca tāraṇī || 120

mātsaryādivipakṣeṇa dānādiṣaḍviśuddhitaḥ | 
rūpavajrādayo bhāvyāḥ śraddhāśuddhyā Yamāntakaḥ | aśraddhāskandhasatkāyajñeyāvaraṇahāritaḥ || 121

kauśīdyakleśamārasya antagrāhadṛśas tathā |
kleśāvṛteḥ prahāṇāc ca prajñāntako' tra vīryavān || 122

smṛtimān padmāntako dhyeyo mithyādṛṅmṛtyujanmahā || 123

devadṛṣṭiparāmarśavikṣepakarmanāśakaḥ | 
samādhirūpato dhyeyaḥ sarvavighnāntakaḥ kṛtī || 124

[p.201]

dānādiṣaḍviśuddhyā tu ṣaḍbhujaḥ sarvadevatāḥ | 
trivimokṣaviśuddhyāsāṃ trimukhākāralābhinaḥ || 125

gāmbhīryaṃ śūnyatāśuddhyā audāryaṃ kṛpayā viduḥ | 
gāmbhīryodārataḥ sarvāḥ prajñopāyātmikāḥ sukhāḥ || 126

lekhyamaṇḍalacihnānāṃ tadvacchuddhyā viśodhanam || 127

rajoniṣpāditaṃ cakraṃ jñātvā pūrṇaṃ samantataḥ | 
vajrābjadhvaninā svāntar jinavṛndaṃ praveśayet || 128

prajñāpadmodbhavaṃ cakraṃ pūrvavat pravibhāvya ca | 
saṃsphārya tataś cakraṃ rajaścakre niveśayet || 129

jñānacakre samānīya datvārghādi ca pūrvavat |
jaḥ hūṃ vaṃ hoḥ praveśādi yamāntakādibhiḥ sṛjet || 130

cakṣuḥkāyādyadhiṣṭhānaṃ punar arghādipūjanam | 
stutvā praṇamya samprīṇya japtvā vibhāvya toṣayet || 131

dikpālān vasvayogasthān prapūjya maṇḍalaṃ viśet || 132

trailokyavijayībhūtvā yathāptābharaṇāmbaraḥ | 
kṛtapradakṣiṇaś cakraṃ natvā homena pūrayet || 133

cakrasādhanam evaṃ syād visarjanam athocyate || 134

pūrvadvārādisaṃviṣṭa ācāryaḥ susamāhitaḥ | 
samādhitritayaṃ kṛtvā guhyetaraprapūjayā || 135

[p. 202]

sampūjyāmṛtāsvādaṃ <ca> kārayitvā stuyāt tataḥ | 
jñānacakraṃ samānītaṃ visarjya samayaṃ tataḥ | dharmadhātusvarūpeṇāpratighaṃ sarvato sukham || 136

oṃ kṛto vaḥ sarvasattvārthaḥ siddhiṃ datvā yathānugām | gacchadhvam buddhaviṣayaṃ punar ā<gamanā>ya muḥ || 137

tatkāyacittavajrādisvakāyādau praveśayet | bhagnacaityādibhittyādilikhitānām ayaṃ kramaḥ || 138

muṃ-kāraṃ mantram uccārya vajreṇollekhayed6 rajaḥ | pravāhayet mahānādyaṃ gītavādyādipūrvakam || 139

cakradevatayos tattvaṃ bhinnam eveti kecana | 
rakṣācakraṃ ca cakraṃ ceti nirdiṣṭaḥ || * ||

(iii. japa/jâpa :)
idānīṃ jāpa ity uddiṣṭanirdeśo vaktavya ity ucyate. tatra jāpārtham uktaṃ tantre—

tribhedavajraparyantaṃ nyāso 'yaṃ trivajram ucyate |
[p. 203]
trividhaṃ spharaṇaṃ kāryaṃ kāyavākcittasaṃnidhau || 1

buddhānāṃ kāyavākcittaṃ dhyātvā bu<ddhāgrapūja>naṃ |
kartavyaṃ jñānavajreṇa idaṃ bodhinayaṃ dṛḍham || 2

uccārayan sphared vajrān samāptau saṃhāram āviśet |
anena jāpavajreṇa trivajracittasamo bhavet || 3

japaṃ jalpanam ākhyātaṃ sarvaṃ vāṅ mantram ucyate |
mantraṃ mantram iti proktaṃ tattvacodanabhāṣaṇam ||4

pratītyotpadyate yad yad indriyair viṣayair manaḥ |
tat mano mananam proktaṃ trakāraṃ trāṇanārthataḥ || 5

tribhedeneti svadevatāhṛtkaṇṭhaśiraḥsu vajrapadmacakramadhyasthavajraparyantam iti cittavajrādibhedena. nyāsas trivajram ucyata iti trivajrāṇāṃ nyāsa iti ucyate. trayāṇāṃ vajrāṇāṃ vā samāhāras trivajram ucyate. atha vā vajraparyantam iti jñānasattva-nyāsaparyantaṃ nyāsaḥ kāryaḥ. trividhaṃ spharaṇaṃ kāryam iti kāyavajrādihṛccandreṣu
[p. 204]
oṃ āḥ hūṃ iti mantroccāraṇakāle kāyavajrādi spharaṇīyaṃ, jñānasattvahṛccandrasthabījoccāraṇakāle tasyāpi spharaṇam, ity upadeśaḥ. tatropadeśād vāyuvāruṇamāhendrāgneyamaṇḍaleṣu kṛtvā, yathāsaṅkhyaṃ kāyavajravāgvajrajñānasattvacittavajrān svamantroccāraṇakāle sphārayed iti. anye tu bījānām evety āhuḥ. kāyavākcittasaṃnidhāv iti kāyavākcittamantrāt. apare tu jñānasattvabījād eva manyante. eke tu ekacandramaṇḍalasthānām eva bījānāṃ spharaṇaṃ varṇayanti. buddhānāṃ kāyavākcittaṃ dhyātvā buddhāgrapūjanam iti <teṣāṃ eva spharaṇakāle pratyekaṃ rūpavajrādikam saṃsphārya pūjanaṃ kāyavajrādīnāṃ kārayet.> jñānavajreṇeti nirālambanajñānena. jñānasattvād rūpavajrāḥ sphāryā iti kecit. uccārayan sphared vajrān iti uccāraṇakāle prāṇavāyunā saha vajrāṇi kāyādivajrāt spharet. samāptau saṃhāram iti sarvoccāraṇasamāptau apānavāyunā saha saṃhāram āviśet kuryāt. tad uktam—
uccārayan spharet prāṇair mantram āyāmasaṃhṛtam
iti. anena jāpavajreṇeti anāsaktyānupalambhena kriyāmāṇo jāpa eva vajro bhaved, yas tena. vajrajāpakrameṇa vā. trivajracittasamo bhaved iti trivajrāṇāṃ cittātmatveṇa samaḥ samatātmako bhaved yogī japāvasthāyāṃ phalāvasthāyām vā. tad uktam atraiva bhagavatā—
vajrajāpaṃ mahājñānaṃ trikāyābhedyalakṣaṇam |
prāpyante buddhajñānāni trivajrābhedyabhāvanaiḥ |
jāpena vajraprayogeṇa sarvabuddhair ādhiṣṭhyata
iti. vajramaṇḍālaṃkāre 'py uktam—
hṛtkaṇṭhoṣṭhena jihvāyāṃ tāluke mūrdhanīva ca |
adhyātmaṃ ca bahirdhā ca ubhayor antareṇa ca |
[p. 205]
kevalaṃ dharmamātraṃ tu jāpaśabdo’ py aniśritaḥ
iti. jāpaśabdārtham āha. japaṃ jalpanam ity antarbahirjalpo jāpa ity arthaḥ. tattvadṛṣṭīnāṃ tu sarvaiva mantram ity āha sarvavāṅ mantram ucyata iti. mantrārtham āha. mantraṃ mantram iti tattvasya saṃcodanam bhāṣaṇam iti. pratītyābhidhānam ākāraṇaṃ vā. tad uktaṃ bhagavatā—
mantram āmantraṇaṃ proktam abhimukhīkaraṇaṃ yataḥ |
yathā kaścit mahāpuruṣa āhūtaḥ śabdavikramaiḥ |
āyāti śrutamātreṇa tadvad bu<ddhāgamaḥ>kṣaṇād
iti. mananatrāṇanātmakena mantrasya bodhicittātmatām āha. yad yad iti tat pratītyasamutpannatvena mananaṃ śūnyatayā nirūpaṇam. tad uktam—
yat pratītyasamutpannaṃ <notpannaṃ tat> svabhāvataḥ |
punaś coktam—
yat pratītyasamutpannaṃ śūnyatāṃ tāṃ pracakṣate ceti |
iti. maṃkārasyārthaḥ. trakāraṃ trāṇanārthata iti. trāyante sarvasattvā aneneti trāṇanam. karuṇā tasyārthatas traśabdaḥ. ataḥ śūnyatākaruṇābhinnaṃ bodhicittam iti smṛtam iti nyāyād bodhicittaṃ paramārthamantram akṣarātmakatve tatsūcakatvenopacārāt paramārthato' bhedād vā tadrūpeṇālambād veti. evaṃbhūtaś ca jāpo napuṃsakajāpa ity ucyate. tad uktam atraiva prastāve bhagavatā—
[p. 206]
trivajrasamayaṃ tattvaṃ <madhyamaṃ> samayavajriṇām |
tad eva sarvavajrāṇāṃ jāpo napuṃsakajāpa ity ucyate |
tad uktam atraiva bhagavatā―
trivajrasamayaṃ tattvaṃ madhyamaṃ samayavajriṇām |
tad eva sarvavajrāṇāṃ jāpo na puṃsakaḥ smṛtaḥ
iti. trivajrasamayaṃ kāyavākcittābhedyadevatālambanarūpam | tattvam iti tasyāpi tattvam anupalambhākārā prajñā tad eva madhyamaṃ madhyamā pratipat | sadasatpakṣahīnatvād iti | samayavajriṇām iti mohakuladevatānām ayam itthaṃ jāpaḥ. tad uktam―
rāgo 'ṅganā pumān dveṣaḥ mohas tūbhayavarjita
iti. evaṃbhūtaṃ jāpaṃ sarvatathāgatajāpe 'pi atidiśati tad eva sarvavajrāṇām iti | atha vā samayavajriṇām iti | tad eva ca sarvatathāgatānāṃ jāpa ity āha | tad eveti | atha vā tad eva samayavajriṇām | sarvavajrāṇāṃ jāpa iti saṃbandhaḥ | strīpuṃvikalpābhāvān napuṃsako jāpa ity eke |
jāpakāle prakārāntareṇāpi spharaṇam āha bhagavān―.
atha vā spharaṇaṃ kāryaṃ tribhedena prati pratīti ||
tatra oṃkāroccaraṇakāle vāyumaṇḍalasthaṃ oṃ āḥ oṃ hūṃ trivajrādhiṣṭhitaṃ kāyavajraṃ sphārayitvā tata eva rūpavajrādispharaṇena saṃpūjya samāptau saṃharet | tato vāruṇe <vāgvajrasya> oṃ āḥ āḥ hūṃ iti | dṛṣṭvā āḥkāroccāraṇārambhe ityādi pūrvavat |
[p. 207]
māhendre oṃ āḥ maṃ hūṃ ityādi jñānasattvabījaṃ svarūpeṇeti kecit | tathaiva vahnimaṇḍale cittavajrasya oṃ āḥ hūṃ hūṃ iti draṣṭavyam ity evaṃ pūrvoktadevatāyogena japaḥ kārya iti || * ||japatattvam || *

[p. 208]
(iv. guhyābhiṣeka:)
idānīṃ sekā vinirdiśyante. sekāv iti guhyaprajñātmakau pradhānatvāt nirdiṣṭau tāv eva tattvarūpeṇa pratipāditau, anyeṣām etadaṅgabhūtatvāt kāyaśodhanadvāreṇa bāhyatvāc ceti. tatra gṛhītavidyā<cāryā>bhiṣeko mantrī śrāddhaḥ samyag ārādhya sadguruṃ śrutasamayādiśālinīm abhinavayauva<na>tāṃ dvādaśābdādibhedena sarvālaṃkārabhūṣitāṃ kṛtvā guror vāme nidhāya. nānāpūjayā saprajñaṃ guruṃ pūjayitvā kṛtamaṇḍalacakrādiko mantrī nānopahāramaṇḍite vijanasthāne rajasāracite maṇḍale paṭamaṇḍale vā tadekadeśe manonukūlakhaṭvādiśayyāyām upaviṣṭaṃ guruṃ gāthābhir guhyābhiṣekārthaṃ yācayet―

yuṣmat pādaprasādena prāptā me' nuttarakriyā |
adhunābhiṣekaratnena kuru nātha anugraham || 1

śrīmahāsukhanāthena buddhānāṃ tāyināṃ yathā |
darśitaṃ śuddhatattvākhyaṃ tathā nātha prasīda me || 2

nilayāt sarvaduḥkhānāṃ duḥkhād uddhara mām prabho |
anāthe kuru kāruṇyaṃ sarvaduḥkhanikṛntanam || 3

tvat pādapaṅkajaṃ tyaktvā nānyan me śaraṇaṃ prabho |
tasmāt prasīda buddhāgra jagadvīra mahāsukha || 4
iti.

evaṃ śrutvā tu taṃ divyam adhyeṣaṇavidhiṃ param |
śiṣyakāruṇyam utpādya guruḥ śrīmān guṇodadhiḥ || 5

prasannavadano bhūtvā sānukampaḥ praharṣitaḥ |
śrāvayet samvaraṃ divyaṃ viśeṣaṃ guhyam uttamam || 6

hanyās te prāṇinaḥ putra vaktavyaṃ cānṛtaṃ vacaḥ |
adattaṃ ca tvayā grāhyaṃ sevanaṃ parayoṣitām || 7

pālanīyaṃ tvayā bhadra saṃvittasamvaram uttamam |
viṅmūtramāmsaraktaś ca pañcamaṃ cittasambhavam || 8

gavāśvādipradīpaṃ ca śodhanādividhānataḥ |
[p. 209]
bhakṣaṇīyaṃ tvayā nityaṃ samayo' yaṃ mahādbhutaḥ || 9

tataḥ ācāryaḥ sakaladevatācakramadhyasthaḥ svavidyāpadme pañcāmṛtādi prakṣipya, prajñāṃ tatsvābhāṃ yogavatīṃ samyak prajñopāyādvayayogenādhiṣṭhāya, svajñānasattvahṛdayāt nānāraśmiṃ sphārayitvā, sarvasattvān mahāsukhasahajānande pratiṣṭhāpya, tenaiva saṃyogadhvaninā vā sarvatathāgatān ānīya mukhena praveśya paramamahāsukharāgeṇa drāvayitvā, yathāsthāne ānandādibhedena samupalakṣya sthirīkṛtya sahajam, phaṭ-kāravāyvādinā yāvacchakti saṃdhārya, śiṣyaṃ ca vairocanarūpeṇālambya sveṣṭayoginaṃ vā cakṣuḥkāyādy adhiṣṭhāya, taccittam vajramārgeṇa nipatitaṃ svadevīkamalagatam agataṃ vā nāmajyeṣṭhābhyāṃ śiṣyavaktre nipātayet. vajreṇaiva tābhyāṃ nipīḍiteneti kecit. tataḥ śiṣyo 'pi devatāyogavān aho sukha iti bruvan sakalājñānāndhakāravidhamana-paramāmṛtam etad ity adhimucyābhyavaharet. prajñayāpi tathaiva deyam iti kecit.

idaṃ tat sarvavajrāṇām abhiṣekapadaṃ <va>raṃ |
sidhyanti sarvavajrāṇi karmāgraprasarāṇi ca || 10

iti guhyābhiṣekaḥ.

(v. prajñājñānābhiṣeka:)
tataḥ saṃgṛhya padmasthaṃ sapuṣpaṃ cittasaṃbhavam |

svavaktreṇa tu pūjārthaṃ vidyāvaktreṇa vajragam |
grāhayitvā tataḥ śiṣyaṃ svam adhyeṣayati guruḥ | 11

tatas tām atha vā kanyāṃ guruḥ prāgvadadhiṣṭhitaḥ |
adhaūrdhvaṃ karau dhṛtvā vidyāṃ tasmin samarpayet || 12

iyaṃ te dhāraṇī ramyā sevyā buddhaiḥ prakalpitā || 13

cakrakramaprayogeṇa samāsvādaya satsukham |
prajñāsaṃparkataḥ śrīmān tattvaṃ samupalakṣayet || 14

vajraparyaṅkataś cittaṃ maṇyantargatam īkṣayan || 15
[p. 210]
iti.

sāpi bhavyā tatas tasmai samvaraṃ samprakāsayet || 16

kiṃ tvam utsahase vajrin viṅmūtrādibhakṣaṇam |
raktaṃ śukraṃ tathā māṃsaṃ strīṇāṃ bhaktis tathā param |
cumbanaṃ bhagapadmasya brūhi vajrin mahāsukham || 17

tatas tu bhagavān vajrī hasamāna idam abravīt―

kiṃ cāhaṃ notsahe devi śukraraktādibhakṣaṇam |
kāryā bhaktiḥ sadā strīṇāṃ cumbanam bhagam eva ca || 18

nirambaravarāṅgī sā svābjaṃ tattvena darśayet― 19

aho madīyaṃ kamalaṃ sarvasukhasamanvitam |
yaḥ sevati vidhānena tasyāḥam agrataḥ sthitā || 20

dharmadhātur ayaṃ śuddhaḥ sattvadhātupramocakaḥ |
svayaṃ mahāsukho rājā sarvabhāvavyavasthitaḥ || 21

bhagamadhye yad ākāśaṃ pañcavyomair alaṃkṛtam |
karṇikākeśarair yuktaṃ dalāṣṭakavibhūṣitam |
tatrasthaṃ sravate nityam amṛtaṃ bindurūpiṇam || 22

tam ājñāpayati―

bhaja mokṣa hoḥ ||
tato 'sau guruvākyena samyak samupalakṣya ca |
vajradhātvīśvarīṃ nāḍīṃ prajñayādvayayogataḥ |
aṅgulyā codayet kiñcid bhūyo jihvāśalākayā || 23

vikāśaṃ yāti sā nāḍī paraṃ suratavāhinī |
dhātvīśvarī samāpannam iṣṭadaivatacakriṇam || 24

[p. 211]
sukhāsanasamāsīnaḥ paṭādyantarhito guruḥ |
dṛṣṭvā hṛdraśmito buddhair bijārciścoditaṃ sutam || 25

jñānāmbupūrṇasatkuṃbhair vajrāmbhojāmṛtāmbubhiḥ |
rūpavajrādibhiḥ siktvā tatra praveśayet || 26

tataḥ śiṣyo 'pi gurūpadeśena yāvadicchaṃ sattvān saṃsphārya bodhicittaṃ saṃlakṣyotsṛjya svayaṃ padmasthaṃ jihvayā saṃgṛhya pibet. prajñāyaiva mukhena mukhe dadyād iti <kecit>. tato 'nurūpasatpūjādakṣiṇābhyarthitas tayoḥ samutkuṭukayoḥ prāgvat svavāmakaragau karau kṛtvā, tanmūrdhni savyaṃ ca dadyād vidyāvratam guruḥ―

adyārabhya mayā samyag dattā kanyāsya sādhake |
sādhanāya mahābodher vijānantu tathāgatāḥ || 27

iyaṃ te dhāraṇī ramyā sevyā buddhaiḥ prakalpitā |
nānyopāyena buddhatvaṃ śuddhaṃ cedaṃ jagattrayam || 28

advayāḥ sarvadharmās te dvayabhāvena lakṣitāḥ |
tasmād viyogaṃ saṃsāre na kāryaṃ bhavatānayā || 29

idaṃ tat sarvabuddhānāṃ vidyāvratam anuttaram |
atikrāmati yo mūḍhaḥ siddhis tasya na cottamā || 30

iti vidyāvrataṃ dadyād iti || * ||

(vi. haṭha:)
idānīṃ haṭha ity uddiṣṭaṃ nirdiśyate. haṭha iti haṭhasādhanaṃ. tatra samādhitrayayogavān yathoktavidhānena catuḥsandhyādhiṣṭhānatatparaḥ samayasamvarastho yogī nimittam prāpya ṣaṇmāsān<vi>janagiriguhādau bhāvayet.
[p. 212]
yadi na
sidhyati, tadā punar akṣuṇṇavidhinā samayādisthitaḥ punar aṣṭādaśa māsān bhāvayet.
tathāpi yadi na sidhyati, tadāsau sandhyāntare haṭhayogam ārabhet. yo vairocanayogī sa kṛṣṇaḥ, svabhyastaprajñayā sahādvayayogavān, kṛṣṇamāṇḍaleyaiḥ parivṛtaḥ, candrāsanādikūṭāgāram api kṛṣṇaṃ dhyāyāt, abhicāravidhivat.
