(ix. lekhyapratyaṅgirā:)
rakṣārthaṃ vighnaśāntyarthaṃ vā bhūrjapattrādiṣu yathāvadvairocanayogavān puruṣāṇāṃ kṛte <kuṅkumena>, strīṇāṃ tu gorocanayā caturaśraṃ caturdvāraṃ
[p. 219]
caturtoraṇādiyuktaṃ bhūmaṇḍalam ālikhya, tasyābhyantare dvādaśasūcikaṃ viśvavajram, tadvaraṭe 'ṣṭāraṃ cakram, tannābhau ca trikoṇamastakam ardhendubinduśikhopetaṃ hakāraṃ vilikhya, tasyodare oṃ āḥ jinajik amukasya śāntiṃ kuru hūṃ iti likhitvā, pūrvādidiśānāṃ madhye akṣobhyādīnām utsargamantrān, āgneyādiṣu locanādīnām utsargamantrān, cakrasya nemyām oṃ āḥ phala phala tiṣṭha tiṣṭha amukasyopadravādikaṃ bandha bandha hana hana daha daha amṛte hūṃ phaṭ svāhā iti veṣṭayan dakṣiṇāvartenābhyantaraśiraskaṃ likhet. pūrvādidvāreṣu yamāryādīnām utsargamantrān, rūpavajrādiṣaḍdevatīnāṃ svasvasthāne oṃ āḥ hūṃ ity eke <rakṣa>trayagarbhajaḥkārādibījaṃ likhet. tad aṣṭaguṇādinā suvarṇādinā nalikāṃ veṣṭayitvā lākṣāhiṅgulādibhir vidyāṃ kārayitvā pratisthayet.
tataḥ samādhitrayayogavān ācāryaḥ sveṣṭadevatāhṛdaye 'nantaroktaṃ kūṭāgārāntargataṃ cakram, tatra yathāsthānaṃ vairocanādyunnaviṃśatidevatāsvabhāvamantrayuktam nemivinyastamālāmantrapratyekākṣararaśminiṣpannāryāmṛta-kuṇḍalivyūha-vidhvastasarvopadravādikaṃ tannābhau svanāmādyakṣaraniṣpannaṃ sādhyaṃ sādhayitvā, tajjñānam ānīya ekīkṛtya haṃkārakavacavarmitaṃ vajrakāyam | vairocanotsargamantramālayā sravatsudhayā taccharīram abhivyāpyamānaṃ paśyan | raśmimukhanirgatasitavarṇadevatāvyūhaiḥ sitavarṇakalaśāmṛtābhiṣekeṇa saṃyogajabodhi-cittena dravībhūyātmapraveśābhiṣekeṇa vābhiṣiktam | sarvadoṣāpagataṃ bhāvayan punaḥ punar mantram āvartayet | tataḥ pūjayitvā samudgakādisaṃpuṭasthaṃ devatāsthāne bāhūkaṇṭhādau dhārayet | tataḥ śāntir bhavati śāntike karmaṇi ca sarvāṇy
[p. 220]
